{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Behold</b> — When Israel gathers, nations will rise to fight against it." "<b>A threshold</b> — like <b>from the blood that is on the threshold</b>, <b>a resting-place and thresholds</b>." "<b>And also against Judah</b> — that the nations will compel Israel who stand in their land, who are far from Jerusalem and whose redemption has not come, to go with them to besiege Jerusalem. And behold, distress will pass over them when they go."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:50.970329858Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}